    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CARLA: I think we'll leave after lunch. Thank you for all you've done, Cindy.\nCINDY: Are you sure you feel okay?\nCARLA: I feel fine.\nCINDY: {looks at her) I don't know. I've been think- ing, Carly. Maybe you should ‘move.",
      "JULIE: Clown was lonely, Mommy.\nKIM: Pierre, too.\nCARLA: Well, you all heard that, didn't you?",
      "CINDY: Hi, folks. Remember me? Carla's face softens. The girls rush up to Cindy.\nCARLA: -~ Cindy!\nCINDY: Got room for a weary traveller?\nCARLA: Cindy.",
      "CARLA: Well, look at you all.\nCINDY: Hey, you're dressed already. Did you sleep okay?\nCARLA: Great.\nCINDY: Well, you'd better hurry. It's nearly eight. You go to work. I'll get the kids off and clean up. Here's your coffee.",
      "CARLA: I hate laying all this on you.\nCINDY: We'll be back in an hour. I'll get a headache. Meanwhile, you stay here. You'll be safe here."
    ]
